The Enterasys WS-AP3710i is a WiFi 4 Enterprise Access Point that was sold until 7/15/2015 and is supported until 31/7/2020. It features a 800 MHz dual-core NXP P1020 processor and dual ath9k radios with 3x3 MIMO.

{{:media:enterasys:ws-ap3710i_front.jpg?200|}}

